    "File Search indexes your whole disk. Press ↵ to open Privacy & Security, then turn on Ministart under Full Disk Access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件搜索会为你的整个磁盘建立索引。按 ↵ 打开“隐私与安全性”，然后在“完全磁盘访问权限”下打开 Ministart。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File Search reads your disk directly to build a private index on this Mac. In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Full Disk Access, turn on Ministart. If it isn’t listed, click + and choose Ministart from Applications. If access still shows as required, quit and reopen Ministart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件搜索会直接读取你的磁盘，在这台 Mac 上建立私有索引。请在“系统设置”›“隐私与安全性”›“完全磁盘访问权限”中打开 Ministart。如果列表中没有，请点按 +，然后从“应用程序”中选取 Ministart。如果仍显示需要访问权限，请退出并重新打开 Ministart。"
          }
        }
      }
