    "Ministart Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart always tells the model to return only the transformed text, and to treat your selection as material rather than as instructions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 始终会告知模型只返回转换后的文本，并将你的所选内容视为素材而非指令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart can index every folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 可以为每个文件夹建立索引。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart can’t uninstall this app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 无法卸载此 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart could not be replaced. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法替换 Ministart。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart could not find the %@ command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 找不到 %@ 命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart could not frame the request for %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 无法为 %@ 构造请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart could not reach GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 无法连接到 GitHub。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart could not write its private image attachments.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 无法写入专用图片附件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart couldn't save to its actions file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 无法保存到操作文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart has no menu to search": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 没有可搜索的菜单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart is ready. Set a shortcut in Settings to summon it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 已准备就绪。在设置中指定快捷键，即可随时唤出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart leaves it alone, and its models stay out of every model picker.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 不会对其进行更改，其模型也不会出现在任何模型选择器中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart needs OpenCode 2. Update OpenCode, then Check Again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 需要 OpenCode 2。请更新 OpenCode，然后重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart needs the Accessibility permission to read the selected text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 需要辅助功能权限才能读取所选文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart needs the Accessibility permission to read the text you have selected and replace it. If Ministart is already listed, switch it off and on again — a rebuilt app keeps a stale entry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 需要辅助功能权限才能读取并替换所选文本。如果列表中已有 Ministart，请将其关闭后重新打开。重新构建 App 后会留下过期条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart needs the Accessibility permission to read the text you have selected in other apps and replace it. Nothing is read until you press a shortcut.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 需要辅助功能权限才能读取并替换你在其他 App 中选择的文本。按下快捷键之前不会读取任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart sends your selected text to the model with these instructions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 会将所选文本连同这些指令发送给模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart sets %@ itself, so this value is not used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ministart 会自行设置 %@，因此不会使用此值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ministart will relearn your preferred results as you use the launcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随着你使用启动器，Ministart 会重新学习你偏好的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
